  "language": "english",
  "text": "What would happen if you started drinking from a copper cup every morning? It might not seem like a big change, but the effects are surprisingly powerful. When you leave clean water in a pure copper cup overnight, copper ions infuse into the water and those ions are incredibly powerful. They kill harmful bacteria like E. coli and salmonella, making the water naturally purified without any chemicals. Those same copper ions also help boost your immune system, improve digestion by supporting gut enzymes and even enhance iron absorption by helping your body make more red blood cells. The result, better energy, better gut health, stronger immune system. No wonder why all of the billionaires are building homes with copper pipes instead of plastic. They know it helps purify their water automatically without adding chemicals 24 7. All you need to do is fill a copper cup with clean water before bed and drink it first thing in the morning. You'll start to see the benefits. It's an ancient practice backed by science and it could change the way you feel every single day. If you found this helpful, make sure to follow, but also share it with someone who needs to see this.",
